Kau merasakannya, ya.

00:32:29.400 --> 00:32:30.933
Pegang payudaramu sendiri.

00:32:37.966 --> 00:32:39.333
Nah.

00:32:39.966 --> 00:32:40.966
Jangan.

00:32:43.200 --> 00:32:44.200
Jangan.

00:33:16.600 --> 00:33:17.600
Teruslah.

